+## Why
+
+Teams are moving to Tidy Tasks from spreadsheets and need to bring their existing tasks in at once rather than adding them one by one.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add a public helper `importTasks(list, text)`, exported from `src/index.ts`.
+- `text` holds one task per line as `title;priority;tags`; priority may be empty (normal), tags are space-separated; blank lines are skipped.
+- Every valid line is added to the list; the helper returns `{ imported, rejected }`, where `rejected` lists `{ line, reason }` for each line that could not be added, `line` counting from 1.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `task-import`: bulk import of tasks into a list from line-based text.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- New `src/domain/import.ts`, new export in `src/index.ts`, new tests.
+- No change to existing `TaskList` behavior; no new dependency.
